     ccoorree..lluuaa — bootloader core module

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     ccoorree..lluuaa contains core functionality that does not have a more fitting
     module.

     Before hooking into or using the functionality provided by ccoorree..lluuaa, it
     must be included with a statement such as the following:

           local core = require("core")

