           KKEEYY__DDEELLEETTEE     The delete code.  Should generally be checked along
                          with KKEEYY__BBAACCKKSSPPAACCEE for backspace functionality.

     The following key-string constants are defined in ccoorree..lluuaa:
           KKEEYYSSTTRR__EESSCCAAPPEE  The escape key.
           KKEEYYSSTTRR__CCSSII     The ANSI CSI sequence.

     The following menu entry type constants are defined in ccoorree..lluuaa:
           MMEENNUU__RREETTUURRNN          Return to the parent menu.
           MMEENNUU__EENNTTRRYY           A normal menu entry.
           MMEENNUU__SSEEPPAARRAATTOORR       A menu entry that serves as a separator.
           MMEENNUU__SSUUBBMMEENNUU         A menu entry that opens a submenu when se‐
